Cruis'n USA for Windows - licence
=================================

Scope

  This licence covers the Windows program: the files below pc/ in this repository, except pc/third_party (those libraries
  keep their own licences, collected in pc/docs/release/LICENSES.txt) and pc/assets (original Cruis'n USA artwork,
  (C) Midway / Nintendo).

  It does NOT cover the game. The original Cruis'n USA source code in the root of this repository is
  (C) 1994 TV Games, Inc. and is kept here unchanged as preserved by https://github.com/historicalsource/cruisin-usa ;
  no rights to it are granted by this file. The game's ROMs are not part of this repository.

  Parts of it are derived from MAME (TMS3203x and ADSP-21xx CPU cores, V-Unit video and DCS audio behaviour),
  which are BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) Aaron Giles and the MAME contributors.


